    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="40.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 40.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="40.1" corresp="#wit-g-a">⁊ bete man þæ<hi rend="italic">m</hi> cingce, swa hit gebyrige, oððe he ða dæde wrece swiþe deope.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="40.1" corresp="#wit-a">⁊ bete man þam cynincge, swa hit gebyrige, oððe he þa dada wrece swyðe deope.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="40.1" corresp="#wit-q">Et emendetur regi, sicut iustum est, aut ipsum (uel illud) factum nimis profunde uindicet.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="40.1" corresp="#wit-b">⁊ beton ðam kyninge swa hit gebyrige, oððe he ða dæde wrece swyðe deope.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-g-a">And bete man þam cingce, swa hit gebyrige, oððe he ða dæde wrece swiþe deope.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">And such compensation as is fitting shall be paid to the king, or he shall avenge the deed to the uttermost.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-g-a">And appropriate compensation shall be paid to the king, or he shall avenge that deed most severely.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock">And compensation is to be paid to the king, as is fitting, or he is to avenge the deed very severely.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">und büsse man dem König, wie es sich gebührt, oder dieser strafe die That sehr hoch.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">and let compensation be paid to the king as is fitting, or let him avenge the deed very severely.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="340"><ref target="clause:VIIIAtr_34">VIII Atr 34</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">VIII Atr. 34</note>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares VIII Atr 34.</note>
        <note type="textual" source="#rabin-doml">bete man: beton B</note>
      </div>
    </body>
